<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Confirm the change of your e-mail</title>
</head>
<body>
<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
    A change of the e-mail of the account <strong>{$userEntity->username}</strong> to this address was requested. If it was you, confirm it with this link
    <a href="{link //:Web:User:ConfirmEmail:default, $userEntity->id, $token}">here</a>. The link is valid for 24 hours.
</p>

<p>
    If you did not ask for it, just ignore this e-mail, nothing will change.
</p>
</body>
</html>
